    migration: 'Run <code>npx gspec</code> to install the updated agents, commands, and skills, then <code>/gspec-migrate</code> in each project to apply the <code>deployable</code> → <code>module</code> renames and stamp <code>spec-version: v2</code>. Your committed <code>verify.sh</code> needs no change — its <code>FAIL:</code> key is the module name, which the rename does not touch. No files move in this release.',
