      },
      {
        type: 'changed',
        description: '<strong>Passing PRDs are memoized, not re-gated.</strong> The features stage restarts over the whole PRD list on every resume; an already-passing PRD used to burn a fresh budget each time (and its verdict was not stable across re-gates). Each PRD that passes is now recorded with a content hash in the run manifest, and an unchanged PRD is skipped on the next pass — removing a large slice of resume wall-clock.',
      },
