    migration: 'Run <code>npx gspec</code> to install the reinforced QA persona and revision prompts. No workflow changes: a fresh or resumed <code>gspec build</code> picks up all of this automatically, and older run manifests resume normally (memoization and timing simply start populating). A resume that lands on a previously-<code>failed</code> spec now re-validates it — if you hand-edited that spec to unblock, your edit is validated in place, not overwritten. The build now writes <code>.gspec/build/qa-failures.md</code>; add it to your project\'s <code>.gitignore</code> if you do not want run artifacts committed.',
